<!-- Q2 -->
<div class="faq-item">
<button type="button" class="faq-question">
Why is DevOps important for modern businesses?
<span class="icon">+</span>
</button>
<div class="faq-answer">
<p>
DevOps helps businesses deliver software faster, improve collaboration between teams, reduce errors, 
and enhance overall system performance.
</p>
</div>
</div>

